{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36239","headline":"同萧山陈长官县楼登望 · 方干","name":"同萧山陈长官县楼登望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"坐看南北与西东，远近无非礼义中。\n一县繁花香送雨，五株垂柳绿牵风。\n寒涛背海喧还静，驿路穿林断复通。\n仲叔受恩多感恋，裴回却怕酒壶空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36239.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36239","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}